    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφῦρᾰ</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hammer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.434
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
